      "content": "i'm not really sure what you mean by goblins lol. can you just give me the actual technical reasons why certain nodes might be seeing the old IP while others see the new one? i need to know the actual mechanics of the cache hierarchy and propagation, not metaphors.",
      "source": "evaluator"
